{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6530 (F1: 0.6283), slightly higher than the avgpool baseline (0.6501 accuracy). The result suggests transformer aggregation may offer marginal performance benefits, but uncertainty remains about its relative efficacy compared to avgpool due to the small improvement and potential confounding factors. Further experiments are needed to isolate aggregation method impacts."
}

